<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Signal downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Signal downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Brothers Harriman said it downgraded General Signal Corp to short-term &quot;market perfrom/hold&quot; from &quot;market perform/buy.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Earlier Monday, Pentair Inc said it agreed to buy General Signal's pump group for $200 million. General Signal also said its board approved a stock buyback of up to $150 million.</p>
<p>-- General Signal gained 7/16 to 52-7/16.</p>
</text>
